# 红果短剧 去广告 · 分流规则 v1.3（止血版 · Quantumult X）
# 导入位置：Quantumult X → 分流 → 引用 → 填本文件的 raw 地址
#
# 【v1.3 为什么改】
# v1.2 把 hongguoapp.com、hongguosdk.com、tnc*.zijieapi.com、ad.zijieapi.com
# 这四组域名整段 reject 了。它们是照 Loon 社区插件抄来的，没有在红果上验证过。
# 从命名看，hongguoapp.com 很可能就是红果自己的接口域名，tnc*.zijieapi.com
# 是字节的配置下发——拦掉就会直接报「网络错误，请点击重试」。
# 所以 v1.3 把它们全部移到「二、待验证」并默认关闭。
#
# 【用法】先用这一版确认 App 正常，再按组逐条放开，每放开一组就重开 App 测一次。
#
# 【顺序不能改】分流是「第一条命中即生效」，所有 reject 必须排在 direct 之前。

# ==================== 一、纯广告 SDK（默认启用） ====================
# 这些域名只服务广告 SDK，拦掉正常表现是「没有广告可投」，不会影响看剧
host-suffix, pangolin-sdk-toutiao.com, reject
host-suffix, pangolin-sdk-toutiao1.com, reject
host-suffix, pglstatp-toutiao.com, reject
host-suffix, pangle.io, reject
host-suffix, ad.pangle.cn, reject
host-suffix, ad.pangolin.cn, reject

# 广告素材签名位（只签广告，不签正片）
host-suffix, p3-ad-sign.byteimg.com, reject
host-suffix, p6-ad-sign.byteimg.com, reject
host-suffix, p9-ad-sign.byteimg.com, reject

# 电商广告落地页
host-suffix, adim.pinduoduo.com, reject

# ==================== 二、待验证（默认关闭，按组放开） ====================
# 【A 组】红果自有域名：最可疑。hongguoapp.com 可能就是接口主域，
#         放开后若 App 立刻报网络错误，说明它就是接口域名，永远不要拦。
# host-suffix, hongguoapp.com, reject
# host-suffix, hongguosdk.com, reject
#
# 【B 组】字节配置下发：TNC 负责 AB 实验与启动配置，拦了可能卡启动
# host-suffix, ad.zijieapi.com, reject
# host-suffix, tnc0-aliec2.zijieapi.com, reject
# host-suffix, tnc0-alisc1.zijieapi.com, reject
# host-suffix, tnc3-aliec2.zijieapi.com, reject
# host-suffix, tnc3-alisc1.zijieapi.com, reject
# host-suffix, tnc3-alisc1.bytedance.com, reject
#
# 【C 组】字节广告位下发：拦了广告位拿不到配置
# host-suffix, ads3-normal-hl.zijieapi.com, reject
# host-suffix, ads3-normal-lf.zijieapi.com, reject
# host-suffix, ads3-normal-lq.zijieapi.com, reject
# host-suffix, ads5-normal-hl.zijieapi.com, reject
# host-suffix, ads5-normal-lf.zijieapi.com, reject
# host-suffix, ads5-normal-lq.zijieapi.com, reject
#
# 【D 组】剧集广告视频与素材：拦了可能连播放器一起报错，最后再开
# host-suffix, v5-reading-ad.qznovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, v6-reading-ad.qznovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, v9-reading-ad.qznovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, v11-reading-ad.qznovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, v13-reading-ad.qznovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, v26-reading-ad.qznovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, v96-reading-ad.qznovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, v5-bd-daily-reading-ad.qznovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, v5-se-sjy-daily-reading-ad.qznovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, sf3-ttcdn-tos.pstatp.com, reject
# host-suffix, activity-ag.awemeughun.com, reject
# host-suffix, ad.toutiao.com, reject
#
# 【E 组】激进项：语义不明或可能误伤，不确认别开
# host-suffix, frontier100-toutiao-lf.fqnovel.com, reject
# host-suffix, novelapp.ixigua.com, reject
# host-suffix, v6-novelapp.ixigua.com, reject
# host-suffix, default.ixigua.com, reject
# host-suffix, novelapp.fqnovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, v6-novelapp.fqnovelvod.com, reject
# host-suffix, gurd.snssdk.com, reject
# host-suffix, log-hl.snssdk.com, reject
# host-suffix, i-lq.snssdk.com, reject
# host-suffix, mon11-misc-lq.fqnovel.com, reject
# host-suffix, webcast5-open-hl.douyin.com, reject
# host-suffix, sf3-fe-tos.pglstatp-toutiao.com, reject
# host-suffix, dig.bdurl.net, reject
# host-suffix, aeventlog.beacon.qq.com, reject
# host-suffix, api.iegadp.qq.com, reject
# host-suffix, cnlogs.umeng.com, reject
# host-suffix, ulogs.umeng.com, reject
# host-suffix, errnewlog.umeng.com, reject
# host-suffix, ossnt-errlog.umeng.com, reject

# ==================== 三、内容 / 播放域名直连 ====================
host-suffix, fqnovel.com, direct
host-suffix, hongguo.com, direct
host-suffix, hongguo.douyin.com, direct
host-suffix, douyincdn.com, direct
host-suffix, douyinvod.com, direct
host-suffix, byteimg.com, direct
host-suffix, pstatp.com, direct
